msgstr "Esc 取消 · Backspace 停用快捷鍵"

#: src/anduinos_whisper_gtk/app.py:573
#, python-format
msgid "Download %s from Hugging Face?"
msgstr "從 Hugging Face 下載 %s？"

#: src/anduinos_whisper_gtk/app.py:575
msgid ""
"This optional model is hosted by Hugging Face, a third-party service. AnduinOS is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or partnered with Hugging Face.\n"
"\n"
"If you continue, your computer will connect directly to huggingface.co. Hugging Face will receive your public IP address and that address may reveal your approximate location.\n"
"\n"
"Privacy policy: https://huggingface.co/privacy"
msgstr ""
"此選用模型由 Hugging Face 託管，該服務為第三方服務。AnduinOS 與 Hugging Face 沒有隸屬、贊助或合作關係。\n"
"\n"
"如繼續，您的電腦將直接連線至 huggingface.co。Hugging Face 會收到您的公用 IP 位址，該位址可能會透露您的大致位置。\n"
"\n"
"私隱政策：https://huggingface.co/privacy"

